{'symbol': 'CMCSA', 'date': '2023-03-31 09:30:00', 'title': 'COMCAST BUSINESS EXPANDS GLOBAL SECURE NETWORKING PORTFOLIO WITH SOLUTIONS TAILORED FOR SMALL AND MEDIUM BUSINESSES', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--COMCAST BUSINESS TODAY ANNOUNCED THE EXPANSION OF ITS GLOBAL SD-WAN PORTFOLIO WITH THE ADDITION OF TWO NEW SOLUTIONS TAILORED FOR BUSINESSES WITH STANDALONE LOCATIONS. THE SD-WAN SOLUTIONS ENABLE SMALL AND MEDIUM BUSINESSES, WITH EITHER A SINGLE LOCATION OR MULTIPLE STANDALONE LOCATIONS, TO HELP SECURELY CONNECT AND MANAGE THEIR NETWORK, APPLICATIONS, AND USERS.'}